{"articleNo":"2240","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=2240&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012년 푸른아시아 국제환경 자원활동 신청안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.01.16","hit":"9946","attachments":[{"name":"2012 국제환경 자원활동 참가신청서(단체).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=2240&attachNo=69498"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2012년 푸른아시아 국제환경 자원활동 신청안내</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">■ 몽골 에코투어 프로그램 안내</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1. 기간 및 참가비(※단체 참가자는 협의 후 시기 결정합니다)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"17\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"72\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span>구분</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"17\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"246\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span>에코투어 기간</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"17\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"106\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span>활동지역</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"17\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"110\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span>참가비</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"17\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"72\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span>ECO 1팀</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"17\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"246\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">5.24(목)~5.28(월) / 3박 5일</p>\n            </td>\n            