style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">※ (사)푸른아시아 에코투어 환불 규정</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">- 참가일 10일 이전까지 취소 통보 시 : 전액 환불</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 참가일 1일전까지(9~1) 통보 시 :참가비의 15% 제하고 환불</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 참가 당일 통보시 : 참가비 외 50% 제하고 환불<br><br>붙임&nbsp; 2012 국제환경 자원활동 참가신청서(단체) 1부.&nbsp; 끝.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">2012. 01. 16</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">학&nbsp;&nbsp; 생&nbsp;&nbsp; 처</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
